Notes and considerations
- The new_weights logic currently boosts "new_customer" to 0.6 for customer_type == "new" and uses a lower weight for others. These thresholds are 
conservative and maintain previous default behavior when no transaction is provided.
- I left metrics/metrics_logger.py unchanged; it emits a DeprecationWarning for datetime.utcnow (non-blocking). I can update that to timezone-aware 
